<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal ind prod falls 1.9 pct yr/yr in May.</title>
<headline>Portugal ind prod falls 1.9 pct yr/yr in May.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's index of industrial production fell 1.9 percent year-on-year in May, while month-on-month it fell 3.2 percent. the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>					 May 97	Apr 97     May 96</p>
<p>General Index			101.4	 104.7	103.4</p>
<p>Percentage change yr/yr	  -1.9	  +4.8</p>
<p>Percentage change mo/mo	  -3.2	  +0.3</p>
<p>Accumulated 12 months	    +1.4	  +1.7</p>
<p>Base Year = 1990</p>
<p>Mining index			  89.1	  90.8	 89.5</p>
<p>Manufacturing industry	   103.3	 106.3	101.9</p>
<p>Electricity, gas		    95.3	 100.7	112.6</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
